        "reason": "At source BC34 the original MOVEA.L from absolute location4 establishes A6=SysBase. Source BC3A increments byte+127 before reloading SysBase at BC3E and calling SuperState at BC44. The generated NDK ExecBase field map and vendored exec/execbase.i identify +127 as TDNestCnt (task-disable nesting), not an app byte. The seed is scoped to this instruction; subsequent loads retain their original behavior.",
        "source_evidence_status": "hypothesis",
        "confidence": "high",
        "subject_revision": "027ea93b4384a1750f9a4499e1d4fe2e78569d1d318c46797eab1dc0fd702c8b"
